sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as You
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Inboxora server
    participant R as Redis
    participant I as IMAP server
    U->>B: Click folder
    B-->>U: Render cached rows at once
    B->>S: GET changes since last seq
    S->>R: Display fields for new ids
    alt All cached
        R-->>S: Hit
    else Some missing
        S->>I: UID FETCH grouped by folder
        I-->>S: Headers and snippet
        S->>R: Write through
    end
    S-->>B: Changes only
    B-->>U: Merge into list
